# Local-only business documents (drafts, commercial terms, marketing collateral).
# Deliberately NOT versioned: the partnership term sheet carries live commercial
# terms, and git history is permanent and readable by anyone who is ever given
# repo access. Keep these local, or store them outside the repo entirely.
docs/PARTNERSHIP_TERM_SHEET.*
docs/COMPETITOR_INVESTIGATION_BRIEF.*
docs/PRODUCT_OVERVIEW.*
